  lesson: "Small, quiet help is worship too — a good deed done only for Allah is beautiful even when nobody sees it or praises it.",
  mins: "5 min read",
  seoDescription: "A gentle Islamic story for kids: Bilal, eight years old, quietly tidies the mosque shoe rack each day — and learns small unseen help is worship Allah loves.",
